<!-- OrderDetail (design-projects.md §10 OrderDetail, the Order detail of research-crosscut §3.6; style-guide §3.3 Detail; impl-projects.md
    P8b): one sales order, mounted by Projects at Projects/Billing/OrderDetail. Built for the Projects context now (impl-projects.md §4:
    expanded when design-crosscut and Sales need more); appRoot will choose the context then, as Shared/InvoiceDetail does.
    Projects (service/ironstone/projects/BillingServices.xml get#OrderDetail): the sales order a project fulfils, for one who manages money and
    sees one of the projects its lines are linked to (OrderItemWorkEffort); anyone else gets "not available". The title row: the order,
    its customer, the status-bar of the order (read only: Open, Quote proposed, Placed, Approved, Completed), the estimate's state; the
    actions: Send estimate for approval (the order open or proposed, one project the user manages: ironstone.projects.BillingServices.send#Estimate,
    the order becomes a quote and its approval approves it) and Print estimate. The number cards: Total, Milestone shares, Billed. The
    boxes: Details, Projects, Lines (each with its projects, its milestone shares and what they billed), Milestone shares (each with its
    status: billed with the invoice, due, waiting for approval), Invoices (those billing the order, OrderItemBilling). Shares are set on
    MilestoneDetail, lines linked on the project's Money tab.
    Accounting (appRoot Accounting, mounted at Accounting/Records/OrderDetail; design-accounting §14 OrderDetail;
    ironstone.accounting.PayableScreenServices.get#OrderContext): a purchase or sales order of an organization the user
    works in, for a reader of its side. The header with Invoice from order (mantle.account.InvoiceServices
    create#InvoiceFromSource, on the ordered or received basis) and Upload supplier bill (import#Bill), then Items (with what
    was billed and accepted), Invoices and payments, Fulfillment and History.
    Warehouse (appRoot Warehouse, mounted at Warehouse/Orders/OrderDetail; crosscut §3.6 Warehouse row, impl-warehouse P11;
    ironstone.warehouse.PickingServices.get#OrderFulfillment; template/WarehouseOrderDetail.xml): an order with a part at the
    user's facilities, its holds, lines with reserved, on shipments, picked and shipped, its shipments and Create shipment
    (not for a held order); money only with financial read.
    Manufacturing (appRoot Manufacturing, mounted at Manufacturing/Subcontracting/OrderDetail; crosscut §3.6 Manufacturing row,
    impl-manufacturing P14; mantle.work.ProductionServices.get#SubcontractOrder; template/ManufacturingSubcontractParts.xml):
    read only, a subcontract purchase order or a sales order linked to the user's work orders: its header and items with their
    production links (a service line's operation and work order with what was accepted, a sales line's supplying work orders),
    prices only for a buyer or price reader; nothing is placed or approved here.
    Purchasing (appRoot Purchasing, mounted at Purchasing/Orders/OrderDetail; crosscut §3.6 Purchasing row, impl-purchasing P3;
    ironstone.purchasing.OrderServices.get#OrderDetail; template/PurchasingOrderDetail.xml): a purchase order of the user's
    organizations, its header with Place, Approve or Send by status and More (hold, release, close remainder, clone, print as
    of, cancel), its holds, lines (a draft's edited here; a service line's acceptance), approvals, documents and emails, and
    history; each action through the Mantle purchase services.
    Customer Service (appRoot CustomerService, mounted at CustomerService/Orders/OrderDetail; crosscut §3.6 Customer Service
    row, impl-customer-service P3; ironstone.customerservice.OrderServices.get#OrderDetail;
    template/CustomerServiceOrderDetail.xml): a sales order of a customer the user serves, read only but for New case, Link
    to case and Resend confirmation (the stored confirmation as placed); its holds read only. -->
<screen xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xsi:noNamespaceSchemaLocation="http://moqui.org/xsd/xml-screen-3.xsd"
        default-menu-title="Order" default-menu-include="false">

    <parameter name="orderId" required="true"/>
    <parameter name="organizationPartyId"/>
    <!-- Purchasing: the time a print as of was asked for -->
    <parameter name="printAsOf"/>

    <transition name="sendEstimate">
        <actions>
            <service-call name="ironstone.projects.BillingServices.send#Estimate" out-map="sendOut" in-map="{workEffortId:projectId, depth:(depth ? Number(depth) : 2), comments:comments}"/>
            <if condition="!ec.message.hasError()"><script>ec.message.addMessage(sendOut.message, 'success')</script></if>
        </actions>
        <default-response url="."><parameter name="orderId"/></default-response>
        <error-response url="."/>
    </transition>
    <transition name="invoices"><default-response url="//Projects/Billing/Invoices"/></transition>
    <transition-include name="invoiceFromSource" location="component://mr-boss/template/AccountingRecords.xml"/>
    <transition-include name="uploadOrderBill" location="component://mr-boss/template/AccountingRecords.xml"/>
    <transition-include name="releaseCreditHold" location="component://mr-boss/template/AccountingCollections.xml"/>
    <transition-include name="issueSupplierLink" location="component://mr-boss/template/AccountingRecords.xml"/>
    <transition-include name="choices" location="component://mr-boss/template/AccountingParts.xml"/>
    <transition-include name="createOutgoing" location="component://mr-boss/template/WarehousePickParts.xml"/>
    <!-- Purchasing (impl-purchasing P3): the purchase order's actions -->
    <transition-include name="purchaseChoices" location="component://mr-boss/template/PurchasingOrderDetail.xml"/>
    <transition-include name="storeLine" location="component://mr-boss/template/PurchasingOrderDetail.xml"/>
    <transition-include name="deleteLine" location="component://mr-boss/template/PurchasingOrderDetail.xml"/>
    <transition-include name="updateOrder" location="component://mr-boss/template/PurchasingOrderDetail.xml"/>
    <transition-include name="placeOrder" location="component://mr-boss/template/PurchasingOrderDetail.xml"/>
    <transition-include name="approveOrder" location="component://mr-boss/template/PurchasingOrderDetail.xml"/>
    <transition-include name="sendOrder" location="component://mr-boss/template/PurchasingOrderDetail.xml"/>
    <transition-include name="holdOrder" location="component://mr-boss/template/PurchasingOrderDetail.xml"/>
    <transition-include name="releaseHold" location="component://mr-boss/template/PurchasingOrderDetail.xml"/>
    <transition-include name="cancelOrder" location="component://mr-boss/template/PurchasingOrderDetail.xml"/>
    <transition-include name="closeRemainder" location="component://mr-boss/template/PurchasingOrderDetail.xml"/>
    <transition-include name="cloneOrder" location="component://mr-boss/template/PurchasingOrderDetail.xml"/>
    <transition-include name="acceptService" location="component://mr-boss/template/PurchasingOrderDetail.xml"/>
    <transition-include name="asOf" location="component://mr-boss/template/PurchasingOrderDetail.xml"/>
    <transition-include name="printOrder" location="component://mr-boss/template/PurchasingOrderDetail.xml"/>
    <transition-include name="orderContent" location="component://mr-boss/template/PurchasingOrderDetail.xml"/>
    <!-- Purchasing P4: refuse the step waiting (the approvals section) -->
    <transition-include name="refuseOrder" location="component://mr-boss/template/PurchasingOrderApprovals.xml"/>
    <!-- P5: Receipts and inspection's Expected receipt (ASN) -->
    <transition-include name="prepareReceipt" location="component://mr-boss/template/PurchasingReceiptDetail.xml"/>
    <!-- Purchasing (impl-purchasing P6): the order's bills and money -->
    <transition-include name="orderDraftBill" location="component://mr-boss/template/PurchasingOrderBills.xml"/>
    <transition-include name="orderUploadBill" location="component://mr-boss/template/PurchasingOrderBills.xml"/>
    <transition-include name="orderPrepayment" location="component://mr-boss/template/PurchasingOrderBills.xml"/>
    <!-- Purchasing (impl-purchasing P7): drop-ship a customer line from a supplier; confirm a drop-ship order's delivery -->
    <transition-include name="dropShipLine" location="component://mr-boss/template/PurchasingOrderDropShip.xml"/>
    <transition-include name="confirmDelivery" location="component://mr-boss/template/PurchasingOrderDropShip.xml"/>
    <!-- Purchasing (impl-purchasing P9): the change of the order, the supplier's acknowledgement and reminders -->
    <transition-include name="startRevision" location="component://mr-boss/template/PurchasingOrderRevisions.xml"/>
    <transition-include name="recordAcknowledgement" location="component://mr-boss/template/PurchasingOrderRevisions.xml"/>
    <transition-include name="linePromise" location="component://mr-boss/template/PurchasingOrderRevisions.xml"/>
    <transition-include name="sendReminders" location="component://mr-boss/template/PurchasingOrderRevisions.xml"/>
    <!-- Customer Service (impl-customer-service P3): link a case, resend the stored confirmation, its PDF -->
    <transition-include name="serviceChoices" location="component://mr-boss/template/CustomerServiceOrderDetail.xml"/>
    <transition-include name="resendConfirmation" location="component://mr-boss/template/CustomerServiceOrderDetail.xml"/>
    <transition-include name="linkOrderCase" location="component://mr-boss/template/CustomerServiceOrderDetail.xml"/>
    <transition-include name="confirmationFile" location="component://mr-boss/template/CustomerServiceOrderDetail.xml"/>
    <actions>
        <if condition="appRoot == 'Accounting'"><then>
            <service-call name="ironstone.accounting.PayableScreenServices.get#OrderContext"
                    in-map="{orderId:orderId, organizationPartyId:organizationPartyId}"
                    out-map="context"
                    transaction="force-new"
                    ignore-error="true"/>
            <set field="recordFound" from="false"/>
        </then><else-if condition="appRoot == 'Warehouse'">
            <!-- Warehouse (crosscut §3.6 Warehouse row, impl-warehouse P11): fulfillment at the user's facilities -->
            <service-call name="ironstone.warehouse.PickingServices.get#OrderFulfillment" in-map="{orderId:orderId}"
                    out-map="context" transaction="force-new" ignore-error="true"/>
            <set field="orderFound" from="!!orderFound"/>
            <set field="recordFound" from="false"/>
            <set field="outgoingKey" from="'outgoing-' + ec.user.randomString(24)"/>
        </else-if><else-if condition="appRoot == 'Manufacturing'">
            <!-- Manufacturing (crosscut §3.6 Manufacturing row, impl-manufacturing P14): read only, with production links -->
            <service-call name="mantle.work.ProductionServices.get#SubcontractOrder" in-map="{orderId:orderId}"
                    out-map="manufacturingOrderOut" transaction="force-new" ignore-error="true"/>
            <set field="manufacturingOrder" from="manufacturingOrderOut?.subcontractOrder || null"/>
            <set field="recordFound" from="false"/>
        </else-if><else-if condition="appRoot == 'Purchasing'">
            <!-- Purchasing (crosscut §3.6 Purchasing row, impl-purchasing P3): a purchase order of the user's organizations -->
            <service-call name="ironstone.purchasing.OrderServices.get#OrderDetail" in-map="{appRoot:appRoot, orderId:orderId}"
                    out-map="purchaseOrderOut" transaction="force-new" ignore-error="true"/>
            <set field="purchaseOrder" from="purchaseOrderOut?.purchaseOrder || null"/>
            <set field="recordFound" from="false"/>
        </else-if><else-if condition="appRoot == 'CustomerService'">
            <!-- Customer Service (crosscut §3.6 Customer Service row, impl-customer-service P3): a sales order of a customer the
                user serves -->
            <service-call name="ironstone.customerservice.OrderServices.get#OrderDetail" in-map="{appRoot:appRoot, orderId:orderId}"
                    out-map="serviceOrderOut" transaction="force-new" ignore-error="true"/>
            <script>ec.message.clearErrors()</script>
            <set field="serviceOrder" from="serviceOrderOut?.detail || null"/>
            <set field="recordFound" from="false"/>
        </else-if><else>
        <script><![CDATA[
        const out = ec.service.sync().name('ironstone.projects.BillingServices.get#OrderDetail').parameters({orderId: orderId || ''}).call() || {}
        ec.message.clearErrors()
        recordFound = !!out.detail
        if (!recordFound) return
        const L = (text) => ec.l10n.localize(text)
        ord = out.detail
        lineRows = ord.lineRows
        shareRows = ord.shareRows
        invoiceRows = ord.invoiceRows
        projectRows = ord.projectRows
        detailRows = [['Customer', ord.customerName], ['Vendor', ord.vendorName], ['Name', ord.orderName], ['Entered', ord.entryDateText], ['Placed', ord.placedDateText],
            ['Approved', ord.approvedDateText], ['Estimate', ord.estimateText]].filter((pair) => pair[1]).map((pair) => ({label: L(pair[0]), value: pair[1]}))
        const shared = shareRows.length
        sharesValue = shared ? String(shared) : '—'
        billedCount = shareRows.filter((share) => share.invoiceUrl).length
        sendValue = {orderId: orderId, projectId: ord.projectId, depth: '2', comments: ''}
    ]]></script>
        </else></if>
        <!-- Purchasing P7: the order's drop-ship state for a purchasing user of its organization, in any app (an empty kind
            for anyone else); template/PurchasingOrderDropShip.xml shows it -->
        <service-call name="mantle.order.DropShipServices.get#OrderDropShip" in-map="{orderId:orderId}" out-map="dropShipOut"
                transaction="force-new" ignore-error="true"/>
        <set field="dropShip" from="dropShipOut?.dropShip || {kind: null, lines: []}"/>
    </actions>

    <widgets>
        <section-include name="AccountingOrder" location="component://mr-boss/template/AccountingRecords.xml"/>
        <section-include name="WarehouseOrder" location="component://mr-boss/template/WarehouseOrderDetail.xml"/>
        <section-include name="ManufacturingOrder" location="component://mr-boss/template/ManufacturingSubcontractParts.xml"/>
        <section-include name="PurchasingOrder" location="component://mr-boss/template/PurchasingOrderDetail.xml"/>
        <section-include name="CustomerServiceOrder" location="component://mr-boss/template/CustomerServiceOrderDetail.xml"/>
        <section name="OrderNotFound"
                condition="!recordFound &amp;&amp; !['Accounting', 'Warehouse', 'Manufacturing', 'Purchasing', 'CustomerService'].includes(appRoot)"><widgets>
            <container-box type="warning"><box-header title="Not available"/><box-body>
                <label type="p" text="Order ${orderId} is not available: it does not exist, it is not linked to a project you see, or you do not manage money."/>
                <link url="invoices" link-type="anchor" text="Back to the invoices"/>
            </box-body></container-box>
        </widgets></section>

        <section name="OrderFound" condition="recordFound"><widgets>
            <context record-entity="mantle.order.OrderHeader" record-id="${orderId}" title="Order ${orderId} · ${ord.customerName}"/>
            <!-- the header card (style-guide §3.3): the order, its customer and the estimate's state with the status-bar at their right, then the actions -->
            <container style="m-record-header">
                <container style="row items-start q-col-gutter-x-md q-col-gutter-y-sm">
                    <container style="col-12 col-md m-record-title">
                        <container style="row items-center q-gutter-x-sm">
                            <label text="Order ${orderId}" type="h5"/>
                            <label text="${ord.customerName}" type="span" style="text-subtitle1 m-muted"/>
                        </container>
                        <label text="${ord.estimateText}" type="div" style="text-caption m-muted" condition="ord.estimateText"/>
                    </container>
                    <container style="col-12 col-md-auto m-record-status">
                        <status-bar id="OrderStatusBar" status-id="${ord.statusId}" status-flow-id="Default" stages="${ord.stageStatusIds}" read-only="true"/>
                    </container>
                </container>
                <container style="row items-center q-col-gutter-x-md q-col-gutter-y-sm m-record-foot">
                    <container style="col-12 row items-center q-gutter-x-xs q-gutter-y-xs m-record-actions">
                        <container-dialog id="OrderSendEstimate" button-text="Send estimate for approval" icon="sym_o_send" width="560" type="primary"
                                title="Send the estimate of ${ord.projectName} for approval" condition="ord.canSendEstimate">
                            <form-single name="OrderSendEstimateForm" transition="sendEstimate" map="sendValue">
                                <field name="orderId"><default-field><hidden/></default-field></field>
                                <field name="projectId"><default-field><hidden/></default-field></field>
                                <field name="depth"><default-field title="Work breakdown to">
                                    <radio><option key="1" text="Top-level items"/><option key="2" text="Two levels"/><option key="3" text="Three levels"/></radio></default-field></field>
                                <field name="comments"><default-field title="Message to the client"><text-area rows="3" cols="50"/></default-field></field>
                                <field name="submitButton"><default-field title="Send for approval"><submit/></default-field></field>
                            </form-single>
                            <label type="p" text="The order becomes a quote; the client approves the estimate on the project's Estimate milestone, which approves the order and the project."
                                    style="text-caption m-muted"/>
                        </container-dialog>
                        <link url="${ord.printUrl}" url-type="plain" text="Print estimate" icon="sym_o_print" link-type="anchor-button" target-window="_blank" condition="ord.printUrl"/>
                        <link url="${ord.estimateMilestoneUrl}" url-type="plain" text="Estimate milestone" icon="sym_o_approval" link-type="anchor-button" condition="ord.estimateMilestoneUrl"/>
                    </container>
                </container>
            </container>

            <dashboard min-width="150" style="q-mb-sm">
                <number-card title="Total" value="${ord.totalText}" icon="sym_o_shopping_cart" size="sm"/>
                <number-card title="Shares" value="${sharesValue}" icon="sym_o_flag" size="sm"/>
                <number-card title="Billed" value="${billedCount}" icon="sym_o_receipt_long" size="sm"/>
                <number-card title="Lines" value="${lineRows.length}" icon="sym_o_list" size="sm"/>
            </dashboard>

            <container-row>
                <row-col md="6">
                    <container-box><box-header title="Details"/><box-body-nopad>
                        <form-list name="OrderDetails" list="detailRows" skip-form="true" skip-header="true" paginate="false">
                            <field name="label"><default-field><label text="${label}" type="span" style="m-muted text-no-wrap"/></default-field></field>
                            <field name="value"><default-field><display/></default-field></field>
                        </form-list>
                    </box-body-nopad></container-box>
                </row-col>
                <row-col md="6">
                    <container-box><box-header title="Projects"/><box-body-nopad>
                        <form-list name="OrderProjects" list="projectRows" skip-form="true" skip-header="true" paginate="false">
                            <field name="name"><default-field><link url="${url}" url-type="plain" text="${name}" link-type="anchor"/></default-field></field>
                        </form-list>
                    </box-body-nopad></container-box>
                    <container-box><box-header title="Invoices · ${invoiceRows.length}"/><box-body-nopad>
                        <form-list name="OrderInvoices" list="invoiceRows" skip-form="true" paginate="false">
                            <field name="invoiceId"><default-field title="Invoice"><link url="${url}" url-type="plain" text="${invoiceId}" link-type="anchor" style="text-mono"/></default-field></field>
                            <field name="dateText"><default-field title="Date"><label text="${dateText}" type="span" style="text-no-wrap"/></default-field></field>
                            <field name="statusText"><default-field title="Status"><display/></default-field></field>
                            <field name="totalText" align="right"><default-field title="Total"><label text="${totalText}" type="span" style="text-no-wrap"/></default-field></field>
                        </form-list>
                        <label type="p" text="Nothing billed on this order yet." style="m-muted q-pa-sm q-mb-none" condition="!invoiceRows.length"/>
                    </box-body-nopad></container-box>
                </row-col>
            </container-row>

            <container-box><box-header title="Lines · ${lineRows.length}"/><box-body-nopad>
                <form-list name="OrderLines" list="lineRows" skip-form="true" paginate="false">
                    <field name="orderItemSeqId"><default-field title="#"><display/></default-field></field>
                    <field name="description"><default-field title="Description">
                        <label text="${description}" type="div"/>
                        <label text="${projectText ? 'Project: ' + projectText : ''}" type="div" style="text-caption m-muted" condition="projectText"/>
                        <label text="${sharedText}${billedText ? ' · ' + billedText : ''}" type="div" style="text-caption m-muted" condition="sharedText"/></default-field></field>
                    <field name="quantityText" align="right"><default-field title="Quantity"><display/></default-field></field>
                    <field name="unitText" align="right"><default-field title="Price"><label text="${unitText}" type="span" style="text-no-wrap"/></default-field></field>
                    <field name="totalText" align="right"><default-field title="Amount"><label text="${totalText}" type="span" style="text-no-wrap text-weight-medium"/></default-field></field>
                    <columns type="mobile">
                        <column><field-ref name="description"/></column>
                        <column><field-ref name="totalText"/></column>
                    </columns>
                </form-list>
                <container style="row justify-end q-pa-sm">
                    <label text="Total ${ord.totalText}" type="span" style="text-subtitle1 text-weight-medium"/>
                </container>
            </box-body-nopad></container-box>

            <container-box><box-header title="Milestone shares · ${shareRows.length}"/><box-body-nopad>
                <form-list name="OrderMilestoneShares" list="shareRows" skip-form="true" paginate="false">
                    <field name="milestoneName"><default-field title="Milestone"><link url="${milestoneUrl}" url-type="plain" text="${milestoneName}" link-type="anchor"/></default-field></field>
                    <field name="orderItemSeqId"><default-field title="Line"><display/></default-field></field>
                    <field name="shareText" align="right"><default-field title="Share"><display/></default-field></field>
                    <field name="amountText" align="right"><default-field title="Amount"><label text="${amountText}" type="span" style="text-no-wrap text-weight-medium"/></default-field></field>
                    <field name="statusText"><default-field title="Status">
                        <link url="${invoiceUrl}" url-type="plain" text="${statusText}" link-type="anchor" condition="invoiceUrl"/>
                        <label text="${statusText}" type="span" style="text-${statusColor}" condition="!invoiceUrl"/></default-field></field>
                    <columns type="mobile">
                        <column><field-ref name="milestoneName"/><field-ref name="statusText"/></column>
                        <column><field-ref name="amountText"/></column>
                    </columns>
                </form-list>
                <label type="p" text="No milestone shares: set them on a milestone's Billing box to bill the order as milestones are reached." style="m-muted q-pa-sm q-mb-none" condition="!shareRows.length"/>
            </box-body-nopad></container-box>
        </widgets></section>
        <!-- a sales order's supplying work orders, for a user with PRODUCTION_VIEW in any context (impl-manufacturing P5a, §4) -->
        <section-include name="OrderRuns" location="component://mr-boss/template/ManufacturingWorkOrderParts.xml"/>
        <!-- a customer order's drop-ship lines, for a purchasing user in any context (impl-purchasing P7) -->
        <section-include name="OrderDropShip" location="component://mr-boss/template/PurchasingOrderDropShip.xml"/>
    </widgets>
</screen>
